$$CRAFT_SPINE_JSON$$

- the story so far (through-lines, nodes, open exits)
$$STORY_DIGEST_JSON$$

- the prior review's termination judgment (next_seed)
$$PRIOR_REVIEW_JSON$$

- shape targets (advisory) and iteration
$$SHAPE_JSON$$
